(406, '083fd5cb818e2e844aa37c09cf30bac8', 'Saffola Total Pro Heart Conscious Edible Oil', '6d41bb9d3c76a783d025fb45b35344c0', 'Safola', '05403efc6e526f5b570823f2bc7d92a5', 'Oils & Ghee', '9786a7a95b668ee19a1e455f1179fccf', 'Cooking oils', 1, 'L', 'When your family’s heart health is your priority, we know that you go the extra mile to make them follow a heart-healthy lifestyle, to keep them away from heart-related signs like cholesterol. Making the right choices can go a long way in taking care of heart health & an important choice is the oil you use.', 1, 200, 200, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784962176),
(407, '252817505a5fdcd1853220527f94778b', 'Saffola Tasty+ Multi-Source Refined Rice Bran & Corn Cooking Oil', '6d41bb9d3c76a783d025fb45b35344c0', 'Safola', '05403efc6e526f5b570823f2bc7d92a5', 'Oils & Ghee', '9786a7a95b668ee19a1e455f1179fccf', 'Cooking oils', 5, 'L', 'Saffola Active is a multi-source edible oil that is rich in Omega 3 and Oryzanol, making your home-cooked meals healthier and more delicious. Featuring LOSORB Technology, this oil ensures your food absorbs up to 27% less oil, resulting in lighter and more flavourful dishes. Fortified with Vitamins A and D, Saffola Active is perfect for active lifestyles, delivering a healthy and delicious oil blend that brings out the natural flavours of your cooking without altering the taste. With its ability to maintain blood cholesterol levels, this versatile vegetable oil is the ideal choice for creating nourishing and flavourful meals for the whole family.', 1, 950, 950, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784962176),
