(439, '18581c81f418bf739fa6a3e152732c25', 'Pears Pure & Gentle Bathing Bar', '2a8d9c4a2a3f79c4a8bd8e91ac8f425f', 'pears', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '894d782fe7806577779b8e944c4251c6', 'Bathing Soaps', 100, 'g', 'There\\\'s nothing like knowing that your skin is soft, smooth, and glowing. With the right products, you can have that feeling every single day, starting with your cleansing routine. Pears understands this and brings to you its heritage product - the original glycerine soap, Pears Pure & Gentle Bathing Bar. With 100% more glycerine, Pears Pure & Gentle mild bathing bar cleanses your skin for visibly glowing, brighter skin every time you shower.', 1, 50, 50, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784962391),
