(475, '7458aa9c7ef48cbb99b2072998edd692', 'Dove Pink Rosa Beauty Bathing Bar', '4e3b3e5a14c3af9a69fd545ec9053da4', 'Dove', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '894d782fe7806577779b8e944c4251c6', 'Bathing Soaps', 100, 'g', 'Dove Pink Radiance Serum Bar combines gentle cleansing with nourishing care for beautifully soft, glowing skin. Enriched with moisturising cream and a delicate floral fragrance, it helps maintain the skin’s natural moisture while cleansing effectively. The mild, soap-free formula leaves skin feeling smooth, refreshed, and visibly radiant after every wash. Ideal for daily use, this serum bar pampers your skin with a touch of luxury, turning your everyday bathing routine into a moment of indulgent care.', 1, 67, 67, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784962423),
(476, 'f867c9fe6ad6a02a69d5ff5ee9e55735', 'Dove Pink Radiance Serum Bar', '4e3b3e5a14c3af9a69fd545ec9053da4', 'Dove', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '894d782fe7806577779b8e944c4251c6', 'Bathing Soaps', 125, 'g', 'Experience serums in your shower with the new Dove Pink Radiance Serum Bar. The bar is enriched with Radiance Serum, designed to leave your skin visibly radiant and nourished, with every wash. Unlike conventional soaps that can strip away essential moisture and leave your skin feeling dry and uncomfortable, Dove\\\'s carefully crafted pH-balanced formula ensure', 1, 330, 330, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784962423),
(477, '9e7210f8f5603b58a582d71209036a0f', 'Dove Sandalwood Bar for Glowing Skin with Natural Origin Sandalwood & Saffron Extracts PO3', '4e3b3e5a14c3af9a69fd545ec9053da4', 'Dove', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '894d782fe7806577779b8e944c4251c6', 'Bathing Soaps', 125, 'g', 'The new Dove Sandalwood Beauty Bathing Bar is made with natural origin sandalwood oil and saffron extracts. The bar cares for your skin to reveal your natural glowing skin while you feel moisturised. The new Dove Sandalwood Bar is infused with natural origin sandalwood oil and saffron extracts, which deeply moisturise to give you natural glowing skin. Sandalwood is known to keep your skin naturally glowing. It moisturises and soothes skin.', 1, 330, 330, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784962423),
