(479, 'aa2e777cd6183ee5d1a7253d94a3a730', 'Dove Go Fresh Moisture Bathing Bar Soa', '4e3b3e5a14c3af9a69fd545ec9053da4', 'Dove', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '894d782fe7806577779b8e944c4251c6', 'Bathing Soaps', 75, 'g', 'The new Dove Sandalwood Beauty Bathing Bar is made with natural origin sandalwood oil and saffron extracts. The bar cares for your skin to reveal your natural glowing skin while you feel moisturised. The new Dove Sandalwood Bar is infused with natural origin sandalwood oil and saffron extracts, which deeply moisturise to give you natural glowing skin. Sandalwood is known to keep your skin naturally glowing. It moisturises and soothes skin.', 1, 70, 70, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784962423),
(480, '5c4b292527ee74bdb79c91d6a403939a', 'Lifebuoy Total Soap', 'ce32878e7b4b47058565bfc1ad404f3e', 'Lifebuoy', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '894d782fe7806577779b8e944c4251c6', 'Bathing Soaps', 125, 'g', 'The Lifebuoy Total 10 bar is the world’s number selling 1 germ protection soap. Its advanced Silver Shield Formula helps give 100% stronger protection* against germs that cause cold|| cough|| flu and many other infections. Inadequate personal hygiene can lead to a number of issues like illnesses|| skin infections and unpleasant odors. The changing of seasons and seasons like monsoon and winter also raise the threat of flu|| cough and cold. That’s why bathing with soap regularly can help protect from hidden infection-causing germs#.', 1, 150, 150, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784962524),
(481, '846f68764778732641445c80e7714f80', 'Lifebuoy Total Soap', 'ce32878e7b4b47058565bfc1ad404f3e', 'Lifebuoy', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '894d782fe7806577779b8e944c4251c6', 'Bathing Soaps', 46, 'g', 'The Lifebuoy Total Soap Bar offers complete germ protection for you and your family. Formulated with Active5, this soap bar protects your entire family from various bacteria and diseases. The advanced formula builds a protective guard over your skin, keeping away skin impurities and protecting against dust and dirt. Enjoy clean, soft skin and a germ-free bathing experience. Buy Lifebuoy Total Soap Bar now.', 1, 10, 10, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784962524),
(482, '51a825049e32becf7c4a977fc31ee04f', 'Lifebuoy Total Soap', 'ce32878e7b4b47058565bfc1ad404f3e', 'Lifebuoy', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '894d782fe7806577779b8e944c4251c6', 'Bathing Soaps', 125, 'g', 'Lifebuoy, the world\\\'s number 1 selling germ protection soap, has been trusted to safeguard lives since 1895. Formulated with an advanced silver shield formula, Lifebuoy provides stronger protection against a wide range of infection-causing germs. Bathing regularly with this soap can help shield you and your family from illnesses, skin infections, and unpleasant odours, especially during the changing seasons when the threat of flu, cough, and cold is heightened. ', 1, 29, 29, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784962524),
(483, '77bd4881fe33bfc3a6a5df6f289c2f3f', 'Lifebuoy Total Soap', 'ce32878e7b4b47058565bfc1ad404f3e', 'Lifebuoy', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '894d782fe7806577779b8e944c4251c6', 'Bathing Soaps', 164, 'g', 'Lifebuoy is a trusted brand, protecting lives since 1895. Lifebuoy is the world’s number 1 selling germ protection soap^. Its advanced silver shield formula helps give 100% stronger protection against germs. To protect ourselves from infection-causing germs, we must take the right measures. Lifebuoy Total 10 Soap gives you 100% stronger germ protection (As per lab test on indicator organism vs soap bar without actives).', 1, 40, 40, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784962524),
(484, 'affd728fd4d5c71e24222be8166c61c5', 'Lifebuoy Neem & Aloe Vera Soap Bar, 100% Better Skin Protection', 'ce32878e7b4b47058565bfc1ad404f3e', 'Lifebuoy', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '894d782fe7806577779b8e944c4251c6', 'Bathing Soaps', 100, 'g', 'Every day we are exposed to heat, dust and germs. These germs may put us at the risk of skin infections like rashes. That\\\'s why you need a natural germ protection soap. Inspired by Mother Nature, Lifebuoy brings to you the New Lifebuoy Neem with the power of raw Neem. Neem is known in India for its antibacterial properties.', 1, 155, 155, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784962524),
