(492, '2ddfd5222c4af4ead3bf477300116add', 'Lifebuoy Total 10 Soap Bar - Advanced Formula, 100% Stronger Germ Protection', 'ce32878e7b4b47058565bfc1ad404f3e', 'Lifebuoy', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '894d782fe7806577779b8e944c4251c6', 'Bathing Soaps', 150, 'g', 'Lifebuoy is a trusted brand, protecting lives since 1895. Lifebuoy is the world’s number 1 selling germ protection soap. Its advanced silver shield formula helps give 100% stronger protection against germs. To protect ourselves from infection-causing germs, we must take the right measures. Inadequate personal hygiene can lead to illnesses, skin infections and unpleasant odours. The changing of seasons, such as a monsoon and winter, can raise the risk of influenza, cough, and colds. That’s why bathing with soap regularly can help protect you from hidden infection-causing germs.', 1, 118, 118, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784962524),
