(524, '7f8ff5aca68728bab4aa857c2bb2ba0c', 'Garnier Men Power White Anti-Pollution Double Action Face Wash', 'ff6b647ad6a56973d370fa85f59a29e3', 'Garnier Men', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '905db1ee27be285cb6af156af52a7162', 'Face Washes', 100, 'g', 'Elevate your skincare routine with Garnier Men Anti-Pollution Double Action Face Wash. This innovative cleanser is formulated to combat the damaging effects of environmental pollutants on your skin. Enriched with the powerful combination of charcoal and clay, it effectively removes oil, dirt, and impurities, leaving your complexion refreshed and radiant. The dual-action formula not only deeply cleanses but also helps to protect your skin from the stressors that can cause premature ageing. Enjoy a thoroughly cleansed, fresh-looking appearance that lasts all day long. Treat your skin to the nourishing benefits of this exceptional face wash and experience the difference in your skin\\\'s health and vitality.', 1, 319, 319, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784962598),
(525, '5e82166a6ee82adb4f982598545af9dc', 'Garnier Men Tubro Bright Face Wash - Removes Impurities', 'ff6b647ad6a56973d370fa85f59a29e3', 'Garnier Men', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '905db1ee27be285cb6af156af52a7162', 'Face Washes', 100, 'g', 'Garnier was founded in 1904 by Alfred Amour Garnier in Blois, Paris. Starting from hair care products with natural ingredients, Garnier continues to grow and begin to wrestle the world of skin care. Garnier believes that nature has provided the best self-care solutions, so that Garnier products always use natural ingredients. Garnier Men Tubro Bright FaceWash visibly brightens skin by removing impurities, pollutants and dark dead cells. It exfoliates the skin and reduces dullness respectively. It also cleanses the skin deeply, removing oil, dirt and pollution, making the skin look brighter, radiant and feel fresh all day.', 1, 299, 299, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784962598),
(526, '2f00f70c13a3196b4d1f21d1a330c472', 'Garnier Men Turbo Bright Anti-Pollution Double Action Face Wash', 'ff6b647ad6a56973d370fa85f59a29e3', 'Garnier Men', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '905db1ee27be285cb6af156af52a7162', 'Face Washes', 150, 'g', 'Enjoy a brighter and more radiant complexion and fresh-looking skin with the Garnier Men Turbo Bright Anti-Pollution Double Action Face Wash. The 2-in-1 texture of the face wash cleanses and brightens your face in one go. The charcoal in the anti-pollution face wash cleanses your skin from deep within and unclogs pores to reverse the damage caused by everyday aggressors like pollution, dirt, and dust. The Icy Clay reduces dullness, refreshes your skin, and gives you long-lasting radiance and freshness. The brightening Garnier Men Face Wash is perfect for those who have an active lifestyle and want to feel fresh all day.', 1, 479, 479, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784962598),
(527, '730b638a86ea7e9505cae52d956a5f73', 'Garnier Men Acno Fight Anti-Pimple Facewash for Acne Prone Skin', 'ff6b647ad6a56973d370fa85f59a29e3', 'Garnier Men', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '905db1ee27be285cb6af156af52a7162', 'Face Washes', 150, 'g', 'Reveal fresh, bright, and clear skin with the Garnier Men Acno Fight Face Wash. Germs and oil attack men’s skin and clog their pores, giving rise to acne and blackheads. The Acno Fight Facewash fights up to 99.9% of pimple-causing germs to dry pimples, uproot blackheads, and give you skin that is clean and refreshed. Formulated with natural ingredients, the anti-acne face wash also helps control excess oil production and regenerates and repairs your skin to give you a healthy glow. The salicylic acid in Garnier\\\'s face wash for men neutralises the bacteria and cleanses the skin, while the micro-beads gently exfoliate the skin, unclog the pores, and remove blackheads.', 1, 379, 379, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784962598),
(528, 'e7461ba51ab3c6e697395972d7001a6a', 'Garnier Men Acno Fight Anti-Pimple Face Wash', 'ff6b647ad6a56973d370fa85f59a29e3', 'Garnier Men', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '905db1ee27be285cb6af156af52a7162', 'Face Washes', 100, 'g', 'About the product This powerful gel-based face wash from Garnier is formulated to target and combat the root causes of acne, leaving you with clearer, smoother, and healthier-looking skin. Enriched with the soothing benefits of salicylic acid and quick-acting herbal repair ingredients, it dries out pimples, lightens marks, and uproots blackheads, all while tightening pores and reducing pimple redness. The unique formula is also infused with Herba Repair, a natural ingredient derived from blueberry extracts, known for its calming and restorative properties. This anti-acne face wash has anti-inflammatory properties to soothe red, irritated skin, treating acne-causing bacteria and freeing the skin of pore-clogging impurities, all while keeping oiliness in check, making it one of the best face washes for oily skin.', 1, 239, 239, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784962598),
