(590, '160541cea54714fd17a7235736ce1dcb', 'Himalaya Men Intense Oil Clear Lemon Face Wash', '1cf9e992d0059f4239745d2ced2ce70e', 'Himalaya', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '905db1ee27be285cb6af156af52a7162', 'Face Washes', 100, 'ml', 'Himalaya Men Intense Oil Clear Lemon Face Wash is a soap-free, herbal formulation that gently cleanses your face and removes excess oil. It is enriched with Lemon and Indian Willow which help clear excess oil, impurities, and pollutants. It is fortified with Active Boost Technology that increases the penetration of actives and helps in the rapid action of herbs. Lemon peel extract is a well-known astringent. ', 1, 189, 189, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784962636),
(591, 'bc6ab3e17bdd79c4b9b2de9a15b14d64', 'Himalaya Men Intense Oil Clear Lemon Face Wash', '1cf9e992d0059f4239745d2ced2ce70e', 'Himalaya', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '905db1ee27be285cb6af156af52a7162', 'Face Washes', 50, 'ml', 'Himalaya Men Intense Oil Clear Lemon Face Wash is a soap-free, herbal formulation that gently cleanses your face and removes excess oil. It is enriched with Lemon and Indian Willow which help clear excess oil, impurities, and pollutants. It is fortified with Active Boost Technology that increases the penetration of actives and helps in the rapid action of herbs. Lemon peel extract is a well-known astringent. ', 1, 99, 99, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784962636),
(592, 'b32db1891ef122aba00573bdc656ca48', 'Himalaya Purifying Neem Foaming Face Wash', '1cf9e992d0059f4239745d2ced2ce70e', 'Himalaya', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '905db1ee27be285cb6af156af52a7162', 'Face Washes', 150, 'ml', 'Himalaya Purifying Neem Foaming Face Wash, developed after extensive research, is a combination of Neem and Turmeric. Neem is well-known for its antibacterial, antiviral and germicidal properties, which help control acne, pimples and prevent their recurrence. ', 1, 250, 250, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784962636),
(593, '102e88080494d3ac13e4f0f7e467f98e', 'Himalaya Natural Glow Rose Face Wash - Removes Impurities & Dirt', '1cf9e992d0059f4239745d2ced2ce70e', 'Himalaya', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '905db1ee27be285cb6af156af52a7162', 'Face Washes', 100, 'ml', 'Nature’s love and gentle care are all you need for beautiful and radiant skin. Himalaya Natural Glow Rose Face Wash contains the goodness of Rose Extracts. It gently removes impurities and dullness, bringing out the skin’s natural glow. The lingering fragrance of Rose calms, pampers and imparts a rejuvenated feel.', 1, 189, 189, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784962636),
