(1320, 'd60cb8eca58c781c67cf34ad829e4961', 'Colgate Total Advanced Health Toothpaste', '035ec3f1d33d0711b1060418fe4668cc', 'Colgate', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', 'e10435e7830006afb60dfdc25ef97e20', 'Toothpastes', 150, 'g', 'Colgate Total Advanced Health is an antibacterial toothpaste that fights germs for 12 hours on teeth, tongue, cheeks, and gums, giving you Whole Mouth Health. Its dual Zinc Arginine technology actively seeks out bacteria in your mouth, forming a protective barrier. Colgate Total Advanced Health toothpaste strengthens your teeth by re-mineralising weakened enamel and fights plaque to keep your gums healthy.', 1, 220, 220, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784973885),
(1321, '028643960061e574dc0230131fae85d6', 'Sensodyne Repair & Protect Sensitive Toothpaste', '92a2a407fbfc3971414644a3720f573e', 'Sensodyne', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', 'e10435e7830006afb60dfdc25ef97e20', 'Toothpastes', 100, 'g', 'When the protective layer of the teeth (enamel) wears away or the gums recede, the dentine underneath becomes exposed. When this exposed dentine comes into contact with hot, cold, sweet or sour food and drinks, it can trigger a sharp, short sensation known as tooth sensitivity.', 1, 255, 255, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784973896),
(1322, 'd41c030cd132f0dc2980de9968b0a317', 'Sensodyne Repair & Protect Sensitive Toothpaste', '92a2a407fbfc3971414644a3720f573e', 'Sensodyne', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', 'e10435e7830006afb60dfdc25ef97e20', 'Toothpastes', 70, 'g', 'When the protective layer of the teeth (enamel) wears away or the gums recede, the dentine underneath becomes exposed. When this exposed dentine comes into contact with hot, cold, sweet or sour food and drinks, it can trigger a sharp, short sensation known as tooth sensitivity.', 1, 195, 195, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784973896),
