(1333, '97a1917e82f46d684da6b5879eb2be12', 'Sensodyne Rapid Relief Toothpaste', '92a2a407fbfc3971414644a3720f573e', 'Sensodyne', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', 'e10435e7830006afb60dfdc25ef97e20', 'Toothpastes', 40, 'g', 'Sensodyne Rapid Relief Toothpaste is the solution to your sensitive teeth woes. Formulated with advanced technology, this daily fluoride toothpaste acts rapidly to provide soothing relief from the sharp, short sensations caused by hot, cold, sweet or sour foods and drinks. Its unique mineral-like layer forms over exposed dentine, instantly cushioning the discomfort and allowing you to enjoy your favourite treats without fear of sensitivity.', 1, 95, 95, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784973896),
