(1335, '9b44854b9e8a4f276b98bfb998275176', 'Sensodyne Pronamel Daily Protection Toothpaste', '92a2a407fbfc3971414644a3720f573e', 'Sensodyne', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', 'e10435e7830006afb60dfdc25ef97e20', 'Toothpastes', 70, 'g', 'New Sensodyne Pronamel, dentist recommended toothpaste for advanced enamel protection from everyday acid erosion. Pronamel is Clinically Proven to help rebuild & strengthen dental enamel as its unique formulation helps minerals penetrate deep into the enamel surface, actively reharden and strengthen weakened enamel. Enamel is the most important part of the tooth and essential for maintaining dental Health, loss of enamel leads to long term tooth problems like Yellowing, Cavity and Sensitivity. So, whether you enjoy your daily tea, coffee, citrus fruits, or fizzy drinks, Sensodyne Pronamel helps keep your teeth strong, healthy, and protected – every day.', 1, 140, 140, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784973896),
