(1363, '11aa0b761afd26b15acb3fa06ab53cdd', 'Pepsodent Gumcare+ Expert Protection Toothpaste, (Pack of 3)', '99b5e3feef803d8bc7665b79de80da8f', 'Dabur', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', 'e10435e7830006afb60dfdc25ef97e20', 'Toothpastes', 140, 'g', 'Upgrade to Pepsodent Gum Care Expert Protection Toothpaste today & reduce your dental visits. Pepsodent Gum Care Expert Protection Toothpaste strenghtens Gums from Day 1. Formulated with unique formula with Zinc technology.', 1, 294, 294, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784973913),
(1364, '3d0c25800c7680949cd2b32e80807544', 'Pepsodent 2 In 1 Toothpaste', '99b5e3feef803d8bc7665b79de80da8f', 'Dabur', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', 'e10435e7830006afb60dfdc25ef97e20', 'Toothpastes', 80, 'g', 'Pepsodent 2 in 1 Toothpaste is India’s first combination of paste and gel in one toothpaste. Pepsodent 2in1 toothpaste helps prevent cavities and freshens breath. Pepsodent 2in1 toothpaste’s white paste prevents cavities & makes teeth stronger, while its Blue Gel provides cooling freshness and helps you avoid the unpleasantness of bad mouth odour. Pepsodent 2in1 toothpaste is a perfect family toothpaste that caters to the Oral care requirements of kids & adults alike. Pepsodent 2 in 1 Toothpaste’s peppery mint flavour will be loved by everyone in the family and gives you an instant burst of natural freshness! Pepsodent 2 in 1 Toothpaste contains 95% ingredients of natural origin. Pepsodent 2 in 1 Toothpaste doesn’t contain any heavy metals, triclosan or harmful chemicals. Pepsodent 2 in 1 Toothpaste is 100% safe & clinically proven. Pepsodent 2in1 toothpaste is a quality product of Unilever Dental Research.TM Regd.', 1, 63, 63, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784973913),
(1365, 'edc175a25f7bf629746557aa92dec019', 'Pepsodent Expert Protection Complete Toothpaste', '99b5e3feef803d8bc7665b79de80da8f', 'Dabur', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', 'e10435e7830006afb60dfdc25ef97e20', 'Toothpastes', 140, 'g', 'Elevate your oral care routine with Pepsodent Expert Protection Complete Toothpaste, a comprehensive solution for a confident, healthy, and radiant smile. This advanced toothpaste offers superior protection against cavities, plaque, and gum problems, ensuring your teeth and gums stay in optimal condition. Formulated with an expert dental formula, Pepsodent Expert Protection Complete Toothpaste delivers clean and fresh breath all day long. Suitable for the entire family, old and young, this toothpaste should be a staple in your daily oral hygiene regimen. Enjoy the trusted effectiveness of Pepsodent and experience the benefits of comprehensive oral care with every brushing.', 1, 137, 137, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784973913),
(1366, '716c476b7cba3b14d232b518017b60ee', 'Pepsodent Germicheck+ 12h Germ Protection Toothpaste', '99b5e3feef803d8bc7665b79de80da8f', 'Dabur', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', 'e10435e7830006afb60dfdc25ef97e20', 'Toothpastes', 200, 'g', 'Worried about cavities & root canal treatments? No more! Step Up Your Family’s Dental Hygiene & Anti-Cavity Protection by brushing with Pepsodent Germicheck Anti cavity Toothpaste with 12Hr Germicheck Protection. Pepsodent Germicheck Anti cavity Toothpaste has the power of CPC Clay Technology & Flouride that provides effective Anti-Cavity protection many hours after brushing! So go ahead and enjoy your chocolates without being worried about Cavities.', 1, 135, 135, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784973913),
(1367, '9005766fc29a54dafaf1823e5e433151', 'Pepsodent Germ Protection Clove & Salt Toothpaste', '99b5e3feef803d8bc7665b79de80da8f', 'Dabur', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', 'e10435e7830006afb60dfdc25ef97e20', 'Toothpastes', 201, 'g', 'Elevate your oral health with the Pepsodent Clove and Salt Toothpaste, a powerful blend of nature\\\'s finest ingredients. Infused with the soothing properties of clove oil, this toothpaste helps prevent toothaches and fight tooth decay, while the addition of salt promotes gum health and enhances overall oral hygiene. Boasting superior germ-fighting capabilities, this toothpaste continues to protect your teeth even hours after brushing, ensuring a strong and healthy smile that you can confidently share with the world. Indulge in the refreshing flavour and experience the transformative power of this toothpaste, crafted to keep your mouth feeling clean, fresh, and rejuvenated.', 1, 101, 101, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784973913),
(1368, '76e335ee81923472e9fc44aa638d9f00', 'Pepsodent Germ Protection Clove & Salt Toothpaste', '99b5e3feef803d8bc7665b79de80da8f', 'Dabur', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', 'e10435e7830006afb60dfdc25ef97e20', 'Toothpastes', 100, 'g', 'Elevate your oral health with the Pepsodent Clove and Salt Toothpaste, a powerful blend of nature\\\'s finest ingredients. Infused with the soothing properties of clove oil, this toothpaste helps prevent toothaches and fight tooth decay, while the addition of salt promotes gum health and enhances overall oral hygiene. Boasting superior germ-fighting capabilities, this toothpaste continues to protect your teeth even hours after brushing, ensuring a strong and healthy smile that you can confidently share with the world. Indulge in the refreshing flavour and experience the transformative power of this toothpaste, crafted to keep your mouth feeling clean, fresh, and rejuvenated.', 1, 55, 55, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784973913),
(1369, 'ed20decf99ad72cf6d490b1d3905dc00', 'Pepsodent Sensitive Care Toothpaste', '99b5e3feef803d8bc7665b79de80da8f', 'Dabur', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', 'e10435e7830006afb60dfdc25ef97e20', 'Toothpastes', 70, 'g', 'Pepsodent Sensitive Care Toothpaste is an effective solution for tooth sensitivity and cavity protection. Specially formulated to provide fast relief, it begins working in just 30 seconds, making it a reliable choice for sensitive teeth. Enriched with 5% Potassium Nitrate, it helps soothe exposed dentine nerves and delivers up to 2× faster relief compared to ordinary toothpaste. Whether discomfort is triggered by hot or cold foods and beverages, this fluoride toothpaste offers gentle yet powerful care.', 1, 105, 105, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784973913),
(1370, '24f2ac99ad96becea8ef6ca14160e766', 'Pepsodent Expert Protection Gum Care+ Toothpaste', '99b5e3feef803d8bc7665b79de80da8f', 'Dabur', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', 'e10435e7830006afb60dfdc25ef97e20', 'Toothpastes', 130, 'g', 'Upgrade to Pepsodent Gum Care Expert Protection Toothpaste today & reduce your dental visits. Pepsodent Gum Care Expert Protection Toothpaste strenghtens Gums from Day 1. Formulated with unique formula with Zinc technology. Pepsodent Gum Care Expert Protection Toothpaste not only takes care of your teeth but provides you with the superior gum care. Pepsodent Gum Care Expert Protection Toothpaste REDUCES GUM PROBLEMS IN 7 DAYS (based on clinical study done in 2018).', 1, 438, 438, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784973913),
(1371, 'dfd926eccc580700fb9bad6bf1ae4ee3', 'Pepsodent Germicheck+ 12h Germ Protection Toothpaste', '99b5e3feef803d8bc7665b79de80da8f', 'Dabur', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', 'e10435e7830006afb60dfdc25ef97e20', 'Toothpastes', 18, 'g', 'For strong, white teeth, get the Germi Check Toothpaste from Pepsodent. The superior germ attack power helps fight cavity-causing germs even hours after Brushing and the advanced formula gives you a complete oral care solution. Formulated with fluoride and triclosan, this toothpaste ensures that you have a long-lasting fresh breath. It reduces stains and food remains, giving you plaque-free and germ-free teeth. Along with maintaining your teeth health, this toothpaste prevents your gums from damaged too. The perfect oral care solution for your family, buy Pepdsodent Germicheck Toothpaste in a small, 30 gm tube that can be carried even when you travel!', 1, 10, 10, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784973913),
(1372, 'cd3db2ef43eca401715d4d9f900b3d59', 'Pepsodent Whitening Toothpaste', '99b5e3feef803d8bc7665b79de80da8f', 'Dabur', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', 'e10435e7830006afb60dfdc25ef97e20', 'Toothpastes', 150, 'g', 'Upgrade your oral care routine with Pepsodent Whitening Toothpaste and experience the power of clinically proven whitening. This toothpaste contains Perlite, an effective polishing agent that removes stubborn stains to reveal the natural whiteness of your teeth in just 2 weeks. Formulated with a special germ-fighting formula, it also helps prevent cavities and decay, promoting overall oral health. Pepsodent Whitening Toothpaste is safe on enamel and free from any dangerous bleaching agents, ensuring a gentle yet effective whitening experience. Infused with a refreshing flavour, this vegetarian toothpaste will leave your breath feeling fresh and your smile sparkling clean. Consistent use of Pepsodent Whitening Toothpaste will help you maintain a bright, confident smile while safeguarding your teeth from decay. Upgrade your oral care routine today and experience the difference.', 1, 130, 130, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784973913),
(1373, '674beea676da471419ada438da2cedc3', 'Pepsodent Whitening Toothpaste', '99b5e3feef803d8bc7665b79de80da8f', 'Dabur', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', 'e10435e7830006afb60dfdc25ef97e20', 'Toothpastes', 80, 'g', 'Upgrade your oral care routine with Pepsodent Whitening Toothpaste and experience the power of clinically proven whitening. This toothpaste contains Perlite, an effective polishing agent that removes stubborn stains to reveal the natural whiteness of your teeth in just 2 weeks. Formulated with a special germ-fighting formula, it also helps prevent cavities and decay, promoting overall oral health. Pepsodent Whitening Toothpaste is safe on enamel and free from any dangerous bleaching agents, ensuring a gentle yet effective whitening experience. Infused with a refreshing flavour, this vegetarian toothpaste will leave your breath feeling fresh and your smile sparkling clean. Consistent use of Pepsodent Whitening Toothpaste will help you maintain a bright, confident smile while safeguarding your teeth from decay. Upgrade your oral care routine today and experience the difference.', 1, 59, 59, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784973913),
(1374, '35ebb5cee070cfbe94e17e3f233e1f84', 'Pepsodent Toothpaste - Expert Protection Complete', '99b5e3feef803d8bc7665b79de80da8f', 'Dabur', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', 'e10435e7830006afb60dfdc25ef97e20', 'Toothpastes', 140, 'g', 'Carry a confident, healthy and white smile after using Pepsodent Expert Protection Complete. This toothpaste has an advanced dental formula that protects your teeth and gums from cavities and plaque. Enjoy clean and fresh breath all day long. It\\\'s a complete care kit for your family\\\'s oral health, as this toothpaste should be used by every member- old or young! Along with a floss, Brush your teeth twice a day with Pepsodent Expert Protection Care for great results! Buy this value pack right away.', 1, 203, 203, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784973913),
