(1460, '44a2df9966eb6be8882374cc071af0c2', 'Sunsilk Luscious Thick & Long Shampoo', '7921fb931c1d76bb0351c483b2563268', 'Sunsilk', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 1000, 'ml', 'Transform your tresses with the Sunsilk Lusciously Thick and Long Shampoo, a nourishing formula that strengthens and revitalises your hair. Enriched with a powerful blend of keratin, yoghurt protein, and macadamia oil, this shampoo works to visibly thicken and add bounce to your locks. The keratin acts as a building block, giving your hair strength and resilience, while the yoghurt protein nourishes and the macadamia oil helps reduce breakage. Together, these premium ingredients work in harmony to leave your hair looking up to 2X thicker and fuller, with a soft, shiny, and vibrant finish. Elevate your haircare routine with this luxurious shampoo and experience the freedom to style your hair exactly how you desire.', 1, 1192, 1192, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974012),
