(1464, '3ed20e2f7afefd3c054c42752906c3d0', 'Sunsilk Luscious Thick & Long Shampoo', '7921fb931c1d76bb0351c483b2563268', 'Sunsilk', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 650, 'ml', 'Transform your tresses with the Sunsilk Lusciously Thick and Long Shampoo, a nourishing formula that strengthens and revitalises your hair. Enriched with a powerful blend of keratin, yoghurt protein, and macadamia oil, this shampoo works to visibly thicken and add bounce to your locks. The keratin acts as a building block, giving your hair strength and resilience, while the yoghurt protein nourishes and the macadamia oil helps reduce breakage. Together, these premium ingredients work in harmony to leave your hair looking up to 2X thicker and fuller, with a soft, shiny, and vibrant finish. Elevate your haircare routine with this luxurious shampoo and experience the freedom to style your hair exactly how you desire.', 1, 680, 680, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974012),
(1465, '2016be8c0e48efac7fa8b7a9e6524223', 'Sunsilk Long & Healthy Growth Shampoo - With Biotin, Milk Protein & Argan Oil, For Healthy Looking & Long hair', '7921fb931c1d76bb0351c483b2563268', 'Sunsilk', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 650, 'ml', 'Sunsilk Long and Healthy Growth Shampoo, for longer and healthy-looking hair as gorgeous as you are! The shampoo comes with activ-mix that contains Biotin, Milk Protein and Argan Oil. Biotin is known to support natural hair growth; Milk Protein is known to provide moisture for healthy hair and Argan Oil is known to protect your hair from daily damage. Together, this formula of powerful ingredients keeps hair Healthy looking and long as it grows. (Based on the reduced breakage of naturally growing hair vs non-conditioning shampoo) The shampoo comes with no added parabens. ', 1, 645, 645, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974012),
(1466, '43f408b446d16e19d3b5421ffba14088', 'Sunsilk Hair Shampoo - Biotin, Long & Healthy Growth', '7921fb931c1d76bb0351c483b2563268', 'Sunsilk', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 360, 'ml', 'Sunsilk Long and Healthy Growth Shampoo is designed for longer and healthy-looking hair. The shampoo contains an activ-mix with Biotin, Milk Protein, and Argan Oil. Biotin supports natural hair growth, Milk Protein provides moisture for healthy hair, and Argan Oil protects hair from daily damage. Together, these ingredients keep hair healthy and long as it grows, based on reduced breakage of naturally growing hair compared to non-conditioning shampoo. The shampoo is free from added parabens.', 1, 295, 295, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974012),
(1467, '0e128bae6b134448007596f9f31ee2cb', 'Sunsilk Hair Shampoo - Biotin, Long & Healthy Growth', '7921fb931c1d76bb0351c483b2563268', 'Sunsilk', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 180, 'ml', 'Sunsilk Long and Healthy Growth Shampoo is designed for longer and healthy-looking hair. The shampoo contains an activ-mix with Biotin, Milk Protein, and Argan Oil. Biotin supports natural hair growth, Milk Protein provides moisture for healthy hair, and Argan Oil protects hair from daily damage. Together, these ingredients keep hair healthy and long as it grows, based on reduced breakage of naturally growing hair compared to non-conditioning shampoo. The shampoo is free from added parabens.', 1, 135, 135, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974012),
