(1472, '31b19e62875f6e69eea9c0655a92ab70', 'L\\\'Oreal Paris Extraordinary Oil Nourishing Shampoo For Dry & Dull Hair', 'bfd1f0a16784af4054743d70c1371c62', 'L’Oréal Paris', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 650, 'ml', 'Complete nourishment from root to tip! L\\\'Oréal Paris Extraordinary Oil shampoo is enriched with an optimised combination of oils - Argan, Almond, Jojoba, Olive, Camelina, and Coconut - to offer you strong, thick, and soft hair; whilst leaving it smooth, shiny, and manageable.', 1, 879, 879, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974026),
