(1474, '7f099e8620a24b383ee0bc2daca03bfd', 'L\\\'Oreal Paris Color Protect Shampoo - For Colored Hair', 'bfd1f0a16784af4054743d70c1371c62', 'L’Oréal Paris', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 180, 'ml', 'Color Protect Shampoo by L\\\'Oreal Paris nourishes the hair and transforms its surface, keeping the hair protected and prolonging the color radiance. The Color Protect formula with UV filter- Light Reflecting System combines an active', 1, 190, 190, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974026),
(1475, 'a9fa45d00c9ec140b60b745e42a5eca0', 'L\\\'Oreal Paris Color Protect Shampoo - For Colored Hair', 'bfd1f0a16784af4054743d70c1371c62', 'L’Oréal Paris', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 340, 'ml', 'Color Protect Shampoo by L\\\'Oreal Paris nourishes the hair and transforms its surface, keeping the hair protected and prolonging the colour radiance. The Color Protect formula with UV filter- Light Reflecting System combines an active', 1, 399, 399, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974026),
(1476, '7caedde3491312f67593eea43559fa00', 'L\\\'Oreal Paris Hyaluron Moisture 72H Moisture Filling Shampoo - With Hyaluronic Acid', 'bfd1f0a16784af4054743d70c1371c62', 'L’Oréal Paris', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 1, 'L', 'Tired of dry, dull, and lifeless hair? It\\\'s time to hydrate your hair with intense moisture. Try the all-new Lâ€™Oreal Paris Hyaluron Moisture shampoo that provides long-lasting hydration and easily re-plumps hair. This 72H moisture-filling', 1, 1315, 1315, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974026),
(1477, 'f143795c581d3311f7fde2aa39c23870', 'L\\\'Oreal Paris Hyaluron Moisture 72H Moisture Filling Shampoo', 'bfd1f0a16784af4054743d70c1371c62', 'L’Oréal Paris', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 180, 'ml', 'Tired of dry, dull, and lifeless hair? It\\\'s time to hydrate your hair with intense moisture. Try the all-new Lâ€™Oreal Paris Hyaluron Moisture shampoo that provides long-lasting hydration and re-plumps hair with ease. This 72H Moisture filling', 1, 209, 209, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974026),
(1478, '0e437d81be27e4ecd50bdda5ca098add', 'L\\\'Oreal Paris Hyaluron Moisture 72H Moisture Filling Shampoo | With Hyaluronic Acid | For Dry & Dehydrated Hair | Adds Shine & Bounce', 'bfd1f0a16784af4054743d70c1371c62', 'L’Oréal Paris', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 340, 'ml', 'Long-Lasting Hydration - Provides 72 hours of deep hydration Replenishes Moisture - Rebalances moisture for visibly plumper, smoother hair Restores Shine - Helps hair look bouncy and healthy', 1, 419, 419, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974026),
(1479, 'dc416eee7d57ba74e1657082f784e0a3', 'L\\\'Oreal Paris Hyaluron Moisture 72H Moisture Filling Shampoo | With Hyaluronic Acid | For Dry & Dehydrated Hair | Adds Shine & Bounce', 'bfd1f0a16784af4054743d70c1371c62', 'L’Oréal Paris', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 650, 'ml', 'Tired of dry, dull, and lifeless hair? Quench your hair\\\'s thirst with the L\\\'Oreal Paris Hyaluron Moisture Filling Shampoo, powered by the wonder ingredient of hyaluronic acid. This potent shampoo provides 72 hours of deep, long-lasting hydration, rebalancing moisture and leaving your strands visibly plumper, smoother, and full of life. Specially crafted for dry and dehydrated hair, it enhances bounce and shine, helping you say goodbye to dullness and hello to soft, silky hair. Suitable for all hair types and perfect for daily use, this shampoo combines the science of skincare with the nourishment your hair craves. Weightlessly coating each strand, the hyaluronic acid retains 1000 times its weight in water, maintaining the natural moisture barrier of your scalp and strands. Experience the transformative power of this hydrating formula and unlock the secret to healthy, vibrant hair.', 1, 929, 929, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974026),
(1480, '3e06ca9b58ee8fad7fa72b66ce802871', 'L\\\'Oreal Paris Extraordinary Clay Shampoo', 'bfd1f0a16784af4054743d70c1371c62', 'L’Oréal Paris', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 650, 'ml', 'L\\\'Oreal Paris Extraordinary Clay shampoo with 3 Refined Clays instantly purifies oily roots and hydrates dry lengths. This clarifying shampoo for oily roots and dry ends leaves hair looking beautifully fresh and clean from root to tip for up to 72 hours. Infused with the extraordinary power of pure clay, it makes your hair softer, shinier, and healthier. For best results, use L\\\'Oreal Paris Extraordinary Clay pre-shampoo hair mask, shampoo, and conditioner.', 1, 859, 859, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974026),
(1481, 'aae723013beaac6fd40d7e2978506131', 'L\\\'Oreal Paris Total Repair 5 Repairing Shampoo - With Keratin', 'bfd1f0a16784af4054743d70c1371c62', 'L’Oréal Paris', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 1, 'L', 'L\\\'Oréal Paris Total Repair 5 Repairing Shampoo helps combat the five signs of damaged hair - Hair fall, Dryness, Roughness, Dullness, and Split ends without weighing it down. Damaged hair lacks the natural cement that keeps the hair strong and resilient. To make sure the hair gets the required strength, the L\\\'Oréal Laboratories has included the Keratin XS technology to replicate the hair\\\'s natural cement to target the five major problems. The smallest form of Keratin XS deeply penetrates the fibres to ensure faster repair.', 1, 1250, 1250, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974026),
(1482, 'bd3b57d2ce1d322b2d78bce4b378489f', 'L\\\'Oreal Paris Total Repair 5 Repairing Shampoo', 'bfd1f0a16784af4054743d70c1371c62', 'L’Oréal Paris', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 180, 'ml', '5 Problems. 1 Solution. L\\\'Oreal Paris Total Repair 5 Repairing Shampoo helps fight against the five visible signs of damaged hair - hair fall, dryness, roughness, dullness, and split ends without weighing it down. Damaged hair can lack natural cement which keeps the hair strong and resilient. To ensure cohesion and strength, the L’Oreal Laboratories have created Ceramide-Cement technology to replicate the hair’s natural cement, targeting the five problems. Explore our best hair products to revive and repair damaged hair.', 1, 160, 160, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974026),
(1483, 'd6c359ac4bc0731e45e6ef3f6bbe8fab', 'L\\\'Oreal Paris Total Repair 5 Repairing Shampoo with Keratin XS', 'bfd1f0a16784af4054743d70c1371c62', 'L’Oréal Paris', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 83, 'ml', '5 Problems. 1 Solution. L\\\'Oreal Paris Total Repair 5 Repairing Shampoo helps fight against the five visible signs of damaged hair - hair fall, dryness, roughness, dullness and split ends without weighing it down. Damaged hair can lack the natural cement which keeps the hair strong and resilient. To ensure cohesion and strength, the L’Oreal Laboratories have created Ceramide-Cement technology to replicate the hair’s natural cement, targetting the 5 problems. Explore our best hair products to revive and repair damaged hair.', 1, 79, 79, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974026),
(1484, '6ed8ced99b3d975e25d9156a01b1e08d', 'L\\\'Oreal Paris Total Repair 5 Repairing Shampoo', 'bfd1f0a16784af4054743d70c1371c62', 'L’Oréal Paris', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 340, 'ml', '5 Problems. 1 Solution. L\\\'Oreal Paris Total Repair 5 Repairing Shampoo helps fight against the five visible signs of damaged hair - hair fall, dryness, roughness, dullness, and split ends without weighing it down. Damaged hair can lack natural cement which keeps the hair strong and resilient. To ensure cohesion and strength, the L’Oreal Laboratories have created Ceramide-Cement technology to replicate the hair’s natural cement, targeting the five problems. Explore our best hair products to revive and repair damaged hair.', 1, 379, 379, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974026),
(1485, 'd65d063a2dfbe71f83575b5d099f106f', 'L\\\'Oreal Paris Total Repair 5 Repairing Shampoo with Keratin XS', 'bfd1f0a16784af4054743d70c1371c62', 'L’Oréal Paris', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 650, 'ml', 'Revive and renew your damaged hair with the L\\\'Oréal Paris Total Repair 5 Repairing Shampoo. Powered by advanced Keratin XS technology, this comprehensive formula targets the five key signs of hair damage - breakage, dryness, dullness, split ends, and roughness. Deeply penetrating the hair fibres, the Keratin XS works to replicate the natural cement that keeps hair strong and resilient. Delivering 5X stronger and renewed hair from the very first use, this shampoo helps reverse the effects of heat styling, chemical treatments, and environmental stressors. Infused with a nourishing Repair Concentrate, it leaves your locks looking and feeling healthier than ever before. Experience the transformative power of this repairing shampoo for hair that is visibly stronger, smoother, and more vibrant.', 1, 859, 859, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974026),
(1486, '9466d8c5418310803222df8b8cee6346', 'Loreal Paris Glycolic Extra Gloss Shampoo', 'bfd1f0a16784af4054743d70c1371c62', 'L’Oréal Paris', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 340, 'ml', 'L’Oréal Paris is a truly global beauty brand that combines the latest in technology with the highest in quality for the ultimate in luxury beauty made accessible. Our signature phrase, “Because We’re Worth It”, is meant to inspire every woman to embrace her own unique beauty and reinforce her sense of self-worth. As the biggest beauty brand in the world, L\\\'Oréal Paris has an unparalleled commitment to technology, research, and innovation, providing ground-breaking, high-quality products for women of all ages and ethnicities. The L’Oréal Paris brand encompasses the four major beauty categories – hair colour, cosmetics, hair care, and skin care – and includes such well-known brands as Excellence Crème, Extraordinary Oil Serum, Revitalift Crystal Microessence, 1.5% Hyaluronic Acid Serum, Lash Paradise Mascara, Rouge Signature Liquid Lipstick, among many others. L\\\'Oréal Paris truly believes that, whatever your age, gender, ethnicity or look – We’re all worth it!', 1, 519, 519, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974026),
(1487, 'ef27e32e26c50cdd30f7bf1f4eb098b4', 'Head & Shoulders 2-in-1 Shampoo + Conditioner - Smooth & Silky', '69fd4e653acc4970017abf028a0a63a8', 'Head & Shoulder', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 1, 'L', 'For the first time in India, the Head and Shoulders, 2-in-1 range is specially formulated to have all the dandruff fighting power you expect, while combining the benefits of bothÂ shampoo and conditioner in one bottle. It makes your hair upto 100% dandruff free and surprisingly smooth.', 1, 999, 999, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974037),
(1488, '6dc3623dd3c593412a95183659b01b51', 'Head & Shoulders 2-in-1 Shampoo + Conditioner - Smooth & Silky', '69fd4e653acc4970017abf028a0a63a8', 'Head & Shoulder', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 180, 'ml', 'Discover the ultimate solution for dandruff-free, silky-smooth hair with the revolutionary Head and Shoulders 2-in-1 range. Infused with the brand\\\'s renowned HydraZinc formula, this innovative shampoo and conditioner combo targets dandruff at its source, effectively eliminating flakes while providing long-lasting hydration and nourishment. Enriched with moisturisers, this dynamic duo leaves your hair up to dandruff-free and surprisingly soft, smooth, and irresistibly touchable. Backed by the trusted P&G brand, Head and Shoulders has a global reputation for delivering exceptional results, and this 2-in-1 formulation is no exception. Experience the ultimate in hair care, where the power of dandruff-fighting technology meets the indulgence of a luxurious, salon-quality experience, all in one convenient bottle.', 1, 258, 258, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974037),
(1489, '642fba7dff9fa475698b247fbbc29f34', 'Head & Shoulders 2-in-1 Shampoo + Conditioner - Smooth & Silky', '69fd4e653acc4970017abf028a0a63a8', 'Head & Shoulder', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 340, 'ml', 'Discover the ultimate solution for dandruff-free, silky-smooth hair with the revolutionary Head and Shoulders 2-in-1 range. Infused with the brand\\\'s renowned HydraZinc formula, this innovative shampoo and conditioner combo targets dandruff at its source, effectively eliminating flakes while providing long-lasting hydration and nourishment. Enriched with moisturisers, this dynamic duo leaves your hair up to dandruff-free and surprisingly soft, smooth, and irresistibly touchable. Backed by the trusted P&G brand, Head and Shoulders has a global reputation for delivering exceptional results, and this 2-in-1 formulation is no exception. Experience the ultimate in hair care, where the power of dandruff-fighting technology meets the indulgence of a luxurious, salon-quality experience, all in one convenient bottle.', 1, 479, 479, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974037),
(1490, 'acafba19e1c73daba9af69d8c608c38e', 'Head & Shoulders 2-in-1 Shampoo + Conditioner - Smooth & Silky', '69fd4e653acc4970017abf028a0a63a8', 'Head & Shoulder', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 650, 'ml', 'Unlock the secret to beautifully luscious locks with the revolutionary Head & Shoulders Smooth and Silky 2-in-1 Shampoo + Conditioner. Specially formulated for the first time in India, this innovative product combines the powerful dandruff-fighting properties you expect from Head & Shoulders with the nourishing benefits of a luxurious conditioner. Infused with a blend of carefully selected ingredients and advanced hair care technology, this transformative formula works its magic to deliver up to dandruff-free and surprisingly smooth hair. Experience the convenience of salon-quality hair care at home as this conditioner penetrates deep into each strand, providing essential nutrients and hydration for hair that looks and feels effortlessly beautiful. Whether you have fine, thin hair in need of volume or long, thick hair craving moisture and shine, this versatile 2-in-1 solution is designed to cater to all your hair care needs. Simply apply a generous amount after shampooing, massage gently, and rinse thoroughly for hair that\\\'s soft, smooth, and more manageable than ever before.', 1, 1169, 1169, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974037),
(1491, 'cf57a476baa3bdbb67ea32b9371341b0', 'Head & Shoulders Anti-Dandruff Shampoo - Silky Black', '69fd4e653acc4970017abf028a0a63a8', 'Head & Shoulder', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 340, 'ml', 'Achieve a healthy, dandruff-free scalp and silky, manageable hair with Head & Shoulders Silky Black Anti Dandruff Shampoo. This richly indulgent formula is gentle enough for everyday use, even on colour or chemically treated hair. Infused with Head & Shoulders\\\' Fresh Scent Technology, the shampoo provides an enhanced fragrance experience during use, leaving your hair feeling refreshed and revitalised. Formulated for dry, damaged or frizzy hair, this shampoo effectively targets dandruff while ensuring your locks remain moisturised, soft and exceptionally easy to style. Purchasing this unisex shampoo online saves you a trip to the store and allows you to compare prices and read reviews from other satisfied customers.', 1, 434, 434, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974037),
(1492, '2ed5b5a1b829aafb33e8ede83364d6c4', 'Head & Shoulders Anti-Dandruff Shampoo - Silky Black', '69fd4e653acc4970017abf028a0a63a8', 'Head & Shoulder', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 180, 'ml', 'Richly indulgent anti-dandruff shampoo for dry, damaged or frizzy hair. Leaves hair up to 100% dandruff free. Gentle enough for everyday use, even for color or chemically treated hair. Formulated with Head & Shoulders Fresh Scent Technology featuring enhanced fragrance notes for an improved in-shower scent experience. Up to 100% dandruff free. Visible flakes with regular use', 1, 199, 199, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974037),
(1493, '45a555b25cc24b6c1996d487e6c147ad', 'Head & Shoulders Anti-Dandruff Shampoo - Silky Black', '69fd4e653acc4970017abf028a0a63a8', 'Head & Shoulder', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 72, 'ml', 'Elevate your hair care routine with Head & Shoulders Silky Black Anti Dandruff Shampoo. This gentle, yet effective formula is designed to thoroughly cleanse your hair and nourish your scalp, leaving you with up to flake-free, silky-smooth locks. Formulated with Head & Shoulders\\\' Fresh Scent Technology, this shampoo provides an enhanced fragrance experience, transforming your daily wash into a luxurious, sensory delight. Suitable for colour or chemically treated hair, the Silky Black shampoo is gentle enough for daily use, ensuring your hair remains soft, light, and exceptionally manageable. Unlock the confidence that comes with having dandruff-free, beautiful hair that feels as good as it looks. Experience the convenience of ordering Head & Shoulders Silky Black Anti Dandruff Shampoo online, where you can find the best deals and have it delivered straight to your doorstep.', 1, 79, 79, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974037),
