(1495, '9dd2490e34a066c25b1495f018603844', 'Head & Shoulders Anti-Dandruff Shampoo - Smooth & Silky', '69fd4e653acc4970017abf028a0a63a8', 'Head & Shoulder', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 1, 'L', 'Transform dry and frizzy hair into smooth and silky hair in just one wash. Head & Shoulders Smooth & Silky Anti-Dandruff Shampoo is formulated with added moisturisers to cleanse and restore dry, frizzy hair, leaving you with dandruff-free hair*. You can run your hands through your hair again (*visible flakes only with regular use). It provides 24-hour frizz control for smooth, beautiful-looking hair and has a gentle pH balanced formula for everyday use, even on colour-treated hair.', 1, 1199, 1199, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974037),
(1496, '3cdff852ba460ec176054cfba2527645', 'Head & Shoulders Anti-Dandruff Shampoo - Smooth & Silky', '69fd4e653acc4970017abf028a0a63a8', 'Head & Shoulder', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 72, 'ml', 'Transform your dry, frizzy hair into smooth, silky perfection with just one wash using Head & Shoulders Smooth & Silky Anti-Dandruff Shampoo. Formulated with nourishing moisturisers and silk proteins, this shampoo cleanses and restores your hair, leaving it feeling irresistibly soft and smooth while providing effective dandruff control. Infused with a unique blend of ingredients, it works to hydrate and nourish your hair from root to tip, delivering 24-hour frizz control for a confidence-boosting, flake-free mane. Gentle enough for everyday use, even on colour-treated hair, this pH-balanced formula will have you running your hands through your smooth, beautiful-looking hair with ease. Experience the ultimate solution for dandruff-free, silky-smooth hair with Head & Shoulders Smooth & Silky Anti-Dandruff Shampoo.', 1, 74, 74, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974037),
(1497, '5417d76b112a8e3c6e13915380a0ce79', 'Head & Shoulders Anti-Dandruff Shampoo - Smooth & Silky', '69fd4e653acc4970017abf028a0a63a8', 'Head & Shoulder', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 180, 'ml', 'Transform dry and frizzy hair into smooth and silky hair in just one wash. Head & Shoulders Smooth & Silky Anti-Dandruff Shampoo is formulated with added moisturizers to cleanse and restore dry, frizzy hair, leaving you with dandruff-free hair. Feel free to run your hands through your hair again. (*visible flakes only with regular use) - 24-hour frizz control for beautifully smooth hair - Gentle pH balanced formula for everyday use, even on color-treated hair.', 1, 191, 191, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974037),
