(1516, 'b994ad34a1330d138076b24b4095d5ed', 'Dove Intense Repair Shampoo', '4e3b3e5a14c3af9a69fd545ec9053da4', 'Dove', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 1, 'L', 'Revive your damaged hair with the Dove Intense Repair Shampoo. This powerful formula works to repair the signs of damage, from split ends and dryness to roughness and hair fall. Infused with nourishing fibre actives, it penetrates deep into the hair to rebuild and reinforce each strand, restoring the lost shine and vigour. Gentle enough for daily use, this shampoo immediately repairs and strengthens your hair, leaving it looking and feeling healthier, smoother and stronger. With 10x damage resistance, it protects your hair from future breakage, ensuring you can enjoy beautiful, healthy-looking locks all day long. Trust Dove, a brand renowned for its expertise in skin and hair care, to revive your damaged tresses and give you the beautiful, radiant hair you deserve.', 1, 1370, 1370, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974046),
