(1523, 'c85c7e06f7fcd2f99da80b6c829689ed', 'Dove Dryness Care Shampoo', '4e3b3e5a14c3af9a69fd545ec9053da4', 'Dove', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 180, 'ml', 'Harsh, humid weather taking a toll on your beautiful hair causing damage? Guard your hair against the harsh weather with the Dove Dryness Care Shampoo. It is crafted from a perfect blend of ingredients, the shampoo helps to restore the natural balance of hair making it soft and smooth. To help prevent daily damage, Dove Nutritive Solutions Dryness Care Shampoo gently nourishes normal and dry locks for healthy-looking hair. The shampoo cleans your dry locks gently and gives it a shiny and glossy look. The specially designed formula of this shampoo is perfect for days when your dry scalp needs help. Dove Dryness Care Shampoo is just what you need for smooth and bouncy hair! This moisturising and nourishing shampoo helps to protect hair from damage, for silky, soft hair. ', 1, 172, 172, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974046),
(1524, '545ab376a379613b174383ef4b483ecb', 'Dove Glycolic+ Hydration Shampoo', '4e3b3e5a14c3af9a69fd545ec9053da4', 'Dove', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 650, 'ml', 'Unlock the secret to deeply hydrated, soft, and effortlessly flowing hair with the Dove Glycolic + Hydration Shampoo. Enriched with 5% Hydra-Glycol~ technology and nourishing bio-protein care, this shampoo is designed to repair damage and restore the water balance of your dry, stiff hair. Gently exfoliating the scalp with glycolic acid, it leaves your hair feeling refreshed and revitalised, while the hydrating glycerin, sodium gluconate, and propylene glycol work together to infuse your locks with up to 100 hours of deep hydration. Experience the transformation as your dry, rough hair becomes smooth, supple, and moves naturally, as if flowing like water. ', 1, 818, 818, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974046);
