(1533, 'ec7b0d80ceb596b5616fad2b2d77a634', 'Clinic Plus Strong & Long Shampoo With Milk Proteins & Multivitamins', '23283aa6415e89db4722f6ac742db83f', 'Clinic Plus', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 650, 'ml', 'Discover the secret to strong, healthy, and long hair with Clinic Plus Strong & Long Shampoo. Enriched with milk proteins and multivitamins, this nourishing formula works wonders for all hair types. Designed to strengthen hair from root to tip, it helps reduce breakage and promotes visible hair growth with every wash. Whether you\\\'re looking for a daily shampoo or a solution to maintain hair health, Clinic Plus is your trusted companion.', 1, 525, 525, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974055),
(1534, '01713306e8b96751f767f241dad63eba', 'Clinic Plus Strength & Shine Shampoo With Egg Protein For Strong & Shiny Hair', '23283aa6415e89db4722f6ac742db83f', 'Clinic Plus', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 650, 'ml', 'Discover the secret to healthy, shiny, and strong hair with Clinic Plus Strength & Shine Shampoo. Enriched with the goodness of egg protein, this shampoo is designed to nourish and strengthen your hair from root to tip. The egg protein formula works to reduce breakage, making it a trusted choice for families seeking a reliable hair care solution. Suitable for all hair types, it is the perfect shampoo for women, men, and children alike.', 1, 815, 815, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974055),
(1535, 'fbb9543ed0c0395823b294c9648be4f5', 'Clinic Plus Strength & Shine With Egg Protein Shampoo', '23283aa6415e89db4722f6ac742db83f', 'Clinic Plus', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 80, 'ml', 'Clinic Plus Strength & Shine Shampoo with Egg Protein is the ultimate solution for healthy, shiny hair for the entire family. Infused with the richness of egg protein, this shampoo strengthens your hair from within, reducing breakage and boosting shine with every wash.', 1, 49, 49, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974055),
(1536, 'ce75b03b5ff708f2bc633ee46d9f8369', 'Clinic Plus Strength & Shine Shampoo - Egg Protein', '23283aa6415e89db4722f6ac742db83f', 'Clinic Plus', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 175, 'ml', 'Discover the power of Clinic Plus Strength & Shine Shampoo with Egg Protein, designed to give your hair the care it deserves. Enriched with the goodness of egg protein, this shampoo strengthens your hair from root to tip, reducing breakage and promoting healthy, shiny locks. It works as a mild everyday shampoo that is suitable for all hair types, making it perfect for the entire family. Whether you\\\'re dealing with hair fall or looking for a boost of shine, this shampoo is your ideal companion.', 1, 115, 115, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974055),
(1537, '3faa784094f179f1be0fa0ade23afc59', 'Clinic Plus Strength & Shine Shampoo With Egg Protein For Strong & Shiny Hair', '23283aa6415e89db4722f6ac742db83f', 'Clinic Plus', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 355, 'ml', 'Discover the power of Clinic Plus Strength & Shine Shampoo with Egg Protein, designed to give your hair the care it deserves. Enriched with the goodness of egg protein, this shampoo strengthens your hair from root to tip, reducing breakage and promoting healthy, shiny locks. It works as a mild everyday shampoo that is suitable for all hair types, making it perfect for the entire family. Whether you\\\'re dealing with hair fall or looking for a boost of shine, this shampoo is your ideal companion.', 1, 230, 230, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974055),
(1538, 'c445c5b9a0ebaaa36750e95d98803920', 'Clinic Plus Naturally Strong Health Shampoo', '23283aa6415e89db4722f6ac742db83f', 'Clinic Plus', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 355, 'ml', 'Reveal healthy, lustrous hair with Clinic Plus Strong & Long Naturals Shampoo. Infused with nourishing milk protein and revitalising herbal extracts, this mild, daily-use formula gently cleanses while strengthening and adding shine to your tresses. For best results, pair the shampoo with a Clinic Plus conditioner and hair oil to achieve optimal nourishment and vitality. Simply apply to wet hair, work into a creamy lather, leave on for a minute, and rinse thoroughly. Unlock the power of nature for hair that is healthy, strong, and radiantly beautiful.', 1, 365, 365, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974055),
(1539, '9a324c5b8a0657333faef16675c4f758', 'Clinic Plus Strong Scalp Anti-Dandruff Shampoo', '23283aa6415e89db4722f6ac742db83f', 'Clinic Plus', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 175, 'ml', 'Clinic Plus believes that girls can achieve their true potential when they are raised to be strong. Mothers who empower their daughters by instilling values such as resilience and determination help build the confidence needed to face life’s obstacles naturally. Just as a solid foundation is essential in life, it is equally important for hair, which grows strong when given the nourishment it needs.', 1, 154, 154, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974055),
(1540, 'bf8b79bf10539ca66ff564ead6393a04', 'Clinic Plus Anti-Dandruff Shampoo - Strong Scalp, With ZPTO Formula', '23283aa6415e89db4722f6ac742db83f', 'Clinic Plus', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 80, 'ml', 'Clinic Plus introduces its new Strong & Long Naturals Shampoo. This is a mild shampoo and ideal for daily use. It contains milk protein and herbal extracts for hair that is healthy and shiny. You can use this along with a suitable Clinic Plus conditioner and hair oil for optimum results. Do use this shampoo after oiling your hair to get rid of that greasy, oily feeling as this natural shampoo is going to leave you with hair that\\\'s soft and beautiful. This product here is a big-sized bottle that is going to last you quite long.', 1, 52, 52, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974055),
(1541, 'f04fb7181dffb47d00796e4f51181f4f', 'Clinic Plus Naturally Long Shikakai Shampoo - Amla, Shikakai & Reetha', '23283aa6415e89db4722f6ac742db83f', 'Clinic Plus', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 650, 'ml', 'When a daughter is raised to be strong, she discovers that the confidence to face life\\\'s obstacles comes naturally to her. Clinic Plus encourages mothers to empower their girls by giving them foundational strength, as it is the seed from which innate, natural strength grows. A solid foundation is always essential and empowering both in life, and when it comes to hair as well. Hair can only grow when it is given the strength to do so. This is why Clinic Plus shampoos are imbibed with ingredients that nurture each hair shaft and make girls long, growing hair robust', 1, 385, 385, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974055),
(1542, 'a535ec7472c53c7f2811e78dcd73b771', 'Clinic Plus Strong & Extra Thick Shampoo', '23283aa6415e89db4722f6ac742db83f', 'Clinic Plus', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 650, 'ml', 'Discover the power of Clinic Plus Strong & Thick Shampoo, a perfect blend of rice water protein and Vitamin E designed to nourish your hair and promote visible thickness with every wash. This formula strengthens hair from root to tip, helping to reduce breakage while enhancing its natural beauty. Suitable for all hair types, it is an ideal choice for the entire family.', 1, 871, 871, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974055),
(1543, '3a066a5010452fe00c692e11dc7cc196', 'Clinic Plus Strong & Extra Thick Shampoo', '23283aa6415e89db4722f6ac742db83f', 'Clinic Plus', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 355, 'ml', 'Clinic Plus Strong & Thick Shampoo is infused with the goodness of rice water, protein and vitamin E. This powerful combination works to reduce breakage, nourishes your hair from within, and helps make hair visibly thicker with every wash.^ Choose Clinic Plus Rice Water, Protein and Vitamin E Shampoo for hair that becomes thicker with every wash. It is suitable for all hair types and can be used by the whole family. For best results, gently massage onto wet scalp and hair, then rinse thoroughly. ^Based on lab test vs. uncleaned hair.', 1, 230, 230, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974055),
(1544, 'c9b232f93dfa9d5fb9c5db50e21d1ca9', 'Clinic Plus Strong & Extra Thick Shampoo', '23283aa6415e89db4722f6ac742db83f', 'Clinic Plus', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 175, 'ml', 'Clinic Plus believes that girls who have been raised to be strong become women who face challenges with confidence and determination. A girl is truly empowered when she is guided by her mother to find her inner strength, so she can conquer obstacles she encounters in her journey through life. A solid foundation is always essential and empowering both in life and when it comes to hair as well. Hair can grow when it is given the strength to do so, which is why Clinic Plus shampoos are imbued with ingredients that nourish girlsâ€™ hair and help give it strength.', 1, 115, 115, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974055),
(1545, 'a3c5370d2acd7782675a9b6c9a4a6eae', 'Kaya Clinic Hair Anti-Dandruff Shampoo, Scalp Purifying Factor', '23283aa6415e89db4722f6ac742db83f', 'Clinic Plus', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 200, 'ml', 'The anti-dandruff shampoo is fortified with piroctone olamine that effectively removes dandruff. It contains Vitamin B5 and seaweed extract enriched scalp purifying factor that nourishes, protects the scalp against flaking and prevents it against dryness, thereby increasing its inherent health.', 1, 350, 350, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974055),
(1546, '1602bc30b13aa9dac6a7afa93ad9e0bb', 'Kaya Clinic Hair Root Regen Scalp Revitalizing Shampoo - Basil Root, Sugarcane', '23283aa6415e89db4722f6ac742db83f', 'Clinic Plus', '4c6e9d12565e5eb2cb6bcc49618ff1a9', 'Personal Care', '547d1dde92a43100d29890d806a48b52', 'Shampoos', 225, 'ml', 'Scalp Revitalizing Shampoo gently exfoliates the scalp without leaving the surface dry, helps natural exfoliation, hence promoting cell renewal. Enriched with a unique complex of basil root, sugarcane, lemon apple extract are known to reduce hair fall and impart resilience to the hair shaft.', 1, 950, 950, 0, 'Active', 'ae049c9f5e20ec2fff44344fb9f91025', 1784974055),
